references
Collated
Wireframe

# Video / dataset source clips — large binaries, never committed
datasets/

# Debug scratch (API response dumps, throwaway output)
scratch/

# Generated ML artifacts — CV logs, import reports, DB backups. All of it is
# reproducible by re-running the tool that made it, and artifacts/import alone
# is ~59MB of sample backups.
#
# Ignore the CONTENTS rather than the directory itself: git will not descend into
# an excluded directory, so a `!artifacts/device_tests/` negation below would
# never be reached if `artifacts/` were excluded outright.
artifacts/*
# ...except the on-device test results, which are hand-collected by signing each
# word into the app and cannot be regenerated by re-running anything. A few KB.
!artifacts/device_tests/
sigla-ml/venv/
sigla-ml/models/
sigla-ml/cv_*.json
sigla-ml/ds*.json
sigla-ml/fsl105_import.json
sigla-ml/dedupe_backup.json
sigla-ml/cv_run.log
